I never would've imagined that I'd get to
sleep in a warm futon like this.

00:00:19.210 --> 00:00:22.250
I can't help but feel grateful for
Miss Mineru and the others.

00:00:26.170 --> 00:00:29.500
With this, the formula for the aphrodisiac
ought to be complete.

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:33.580
But testing it only on women
wouldn't exactly be interesting...

00:00:34.880 --> 00:00:36.380
What a marvelous coincidence!

00:00:36.380 --> 00:00:38.540
I happen to know the perfect guinea pig...

00:00:40.580 --> 00:00:44.250
Wh-why am I so cold all of a sudden...?

00:00:45.670 --> 00:00:47.460
I'd better get to sleep...

00:00:48.250 --> 00:00:50.000
My newest creation...

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:52.630
It would look fantastic on Koushi!

00:00:55.750 --> 00:00:58.420
Ugh, the chills just keep getting worse...

00:00:58.630 --> 00:01:00.250
Mr. Fuki Mamoru!

00:01:02.710 --> 00:01:05.380
I vow to uphold moral standards in this dorm!

00:01:06.630 --> 00:01:09.080
I'm feeling a little warmer now...

00:01:11.420 --> 00:01:12.540
What's that...?

00:01:14.790 --> 00:01:18.290
If I remember correctly,
Miss Kiriya's room is right above mine...

00:01:19.630 --> 00:01:20.960
WHA-?!

00:01:21.670 --> 00:01:22.960
Ouch...

00:01:23.330 --> 00:01:25.580
Oh God, I'm so sorry!

00:01:25.960 --> 00:01:27.170
Miss Kiriya?!

00:01:27.580 --> 00:01:31.130
Listen, I don't think I can pull myself up.
Y'mind if I drop down?

00:01:31.130 --> 00:01:32.080
Huh?!

00:01:32.080 --> 00:01:33.420
Ready? Here goes!

00:01:33.420 --> 00:01:35.210
W-wait a second...! It's dangerous!

00:01:40.040 --> 00:01:41.460
M-move outta the way!

00:01:41.460 --> 00:01:42.170
WHAT THE-?!
M-move outta the way!

00:01:42.170 --> 00:01:43.000
WHAT THE-?!

00:01:44.830 --> 00:01:46.500
Ow-ow-ow...

