I wanna kiss you motto motto

00:03:20.960 --> 00:03:25.960
Episode 2

00:03:20.960 --> 00:03:25.960
The Problem with Kiriya and Serene

00:03:28.710 --> 00:03:30.250
K-Koushi...

00:03:31.210 --> 00:03:32.790
Are you alright?

00:03:32.790 --> 00:03:35.880
I-it's hard... to breathe...

00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:40.080
I'll get off! I'm getting off, okay?!

00:03:42.540 --> 00:03:44.250
I am so sorry.

00:03:44.750 --> 00:03:47.080
And I promise to fix the ceiling later.

00:03:47.380 --> 00:03:49.830
How in the world did this even happen...?

00:03:50.380 --> 00:03:51.790
Well...

00:03:52.420 --> 00:03:55.210
It's a long story, and kind of difficult to explain...

00:03:55.670 --> 00:03:57.380
Oh, what's that?

00:03:59.040 --> 00:03:59.670
Kung Fu Lovers

00:04:00.790 --> 00:04:02.920
There's no need to be embarrassed.

00:04:02.920 --> 00:04:05.290
B-but it's weird for someone like me...

00:04:05.290 --> 00:04:07.670
Not really. It's just a shojo manga.

00:04:08.080 --> 00:04:10.170
You think it seems out of character, don't you?

00:04:10.170 --> 00:04:12.170
Wha-? N-no, I...

00:04:13.630 --> 00:04:16.290
It's fine. I'm well aware of that, myself.

00:04:16.960 --> 00:04:19.330
My parents ran a martial arts studio out of our home.

00:04:19.330 --> 00:04:21.290
I was a student there, too.

00:04:21.670 --> 00:04:23.920
Plus, I grew up with a bunch of brothers.

00:04:23.920 --> 00:04:26.210
Suffice to say, it was a masculine environment...

00:04:26.670 --> 00:04:30.130
When I went off to college,
I bought my first shojo manga.

00:04:30.130 --> 00:04:32.380
I couldn't believe that such a sweet
and sparkly world existed.

00:04:32.380 --> 00:04:33.750
I got hooked...

00:04:34.460 --> 00:04:37.880
No one would ever love a girl who starts
throwing punches as soon as she gets angry!

00:04:37.880 --> 00:04:39.290
I hate myself!

00:04:40.330 --> 00:04:41.790
That's not true.

00:04:41.790 --> 00:04:45.130
Everything about you is beautiful,
including your kung fu.

00:04:57.880 --> 00:05:00.500
In that moment, I realized...

00:05:00.500 --> 00:05:03.500
how Miss Kiriya managed to fall through the floor...

00:05:04.920 --> 00:05:07.040
She gets flustered when she reads shojo manga,

00:05:07.040 --> 00:05:09.170
and she's the type of woman
who likes to get physical!

00:05:09.960 --> 00:05:11.830
Crap, I did it again!

00:05:12.670 --> 00:05:15.750
Another resident with
an entirely different set of issues...

00:05:16.460 --> 00:05:18.960
I'm sorry! I'll fix the wall, too!

00:05:18.960 --> 00:05:20.460
U-uh, don't worry about it.

00:05:20.460 --> 00:05:23.670
So! Would you mind if I sleep here for tonight?

00:05:24.500 --> 00:05:25.330
What?

00:05:25.710 --> 00:05:29.080
Please, won't you let me sleep with you in your room?

00:05:29.080 --> 00:05:32.000
I-in my room...? Together?!

00:05:32.380 --> 00:05:34.580
Y'see, I toss and turn a lot.

00:05:34.580 --> 00:05:37.790
If I sleep in my room,
I'll probably fall through the hole again!

00:05:37.960 --> 00:05:39.710
And I have to be up early tomorrow!

00:05:39.710 --> 00:05:40.670
Please!

00:05:40.880 --> 00:05:42.290
But I, um...

00:05:42.290 --> 00:05:45.580
I mean, aren't you worried about
sleeping in the same room as a guy...?

00:05:47.380 --> 00:05:48.830
Doesn't bother me one bit.

00:05:48.830 --> 00:05:50.790
I'm used to it 'cause of my brothers.

00:05:51.580 --> 00:05:54.290
I don't understand her logic at all...

00:05:57.710 --> 00:05:59.290
Hey, Koushi.

00:05:59.290 --> 00:06:01.920
Since I'm here, you wanna talk for a bit?

00:06:02.330 --> 00:06:04.380
Don't you need to get up early tomorrow...?

00:06:04.380 --> 00:06:07.250
I've wanted to have a nice chat
with you for a while now.

00:06:07.250 --> 00:06:11.920
Whenever I look at you, it reminds me
of my brothers back home.

00:06:12.380 --> 00:06:14.830
W-well, in that case...

00:06:14.830 --> 00:06:16.250
Thank you!

00:06:16.250 --> 00:06:17.290
'Kay, here goes!

00:06:17.710 --> 00:06:18.540
Huh?!

00:06:18.750 --> 00:06:20.250
It's much quicker...

00:06:20.460 --> 00:06:21.670
to let our bodies...

00:06:21.880 --> 00:06:23.920
do the talking, don't you think?!

00:06:24.750 --> 00:06:26.130
WHAAA-?!

00:06:26.380 --> 00:06:29.580
My brothers and I used to spar like this all the time!

00:06:29.580 --> 00:06:31.080
Brings back memories!

00:06:31.500 --> 00:06:33.000
This sensation...

00:06:33.000 --> 00:06:34.580
Oh, this is ecstasy!

00:06:37.920 --> 00:06:40.880
That's it, Koushi. You're doing great!

00:06:45.460 --> 00:06:47.330
Limbs all tangled together...

00:06:48.630 --> 00:06:50.500
How long has it been...?

00:06:51.880 --> 00:06:54.080
It feels so good, Koushi...

00:06:54.290 --> 00:06:55.790
How about you?

00:06:56.830 --> 00:06:58.750
Give! I give!

00:06:59.880 --> 00:07:00.710
I'm sorry!

00:07:01.000 --> 00:07:03.540
I allowed myself to get carried away again...

00:07:04.380 --> 00:07:07.170
What was I thinking,
attacking a total amateur like that?!

00:07:07.170 --> 00:07:09.790
It's fine! I'm not mad or anything.

00:07:09.790 --> 00:07:11.040
But I...!

00:07:11.380 --> 00:07:13.460
Um... Listen, Miss Kiriya.

00:07:13.460 --> 00:07:16.630
All of the residents in this dorm
are far too vulnerable.

00:07:16.710 --> 00:07:17.330
Huh?

00:07:17.580 --> 00:07:20.580
I am intimately aware of how strong you are.

00:07:20.580 --> 00:07:23.750
Miss Mineru and the others seem to have
quirks and habits of their own.

00:07:24.130 --> 00:07:26.710
But before anything else, you're all women.

00:07:26.710 --> 00:07:29.210
Um... pretty women, at that.

00:07:30.540 --> 00:07:35.630
I might remind you of your younger brothers,
but you and I aren't related.

00:07:35.630 --> 00:07:37.710
And I'm still a guy, y'know?

00:07:37.920 --> 00:07:41.630
I just wish that you'd be a little more
mindful of that, I guess...

00:07:43.040 --> 00:07:44.000
Or...

00:07:44.000 --> 00:07:47.960
Maybe I'm the pervy brat who needs to
get his mind out of the gutter?!

00:07:47.960 --> 00:07:50.170
Koushi! Where are you going?!

00:07:51.330 --> 00:07:53.460
If you don't mind, I'll sleep up here.

00:07:53.460 --> 00:07:55.250
Please use my room, Miss Kiriya!

00:07:55.500 --> 00:07:57.920
But it's dangerous!
There's a huge hole in the floor!

00:07:57.920 --> 00:08:00.670
I'll be okay. Good night!

00:08:02.210 --> 00:08:04.420
G-g'night...

00:08:09.710 --> 00:08:12.290
It smells like Miss Kiriya in here...

00:08:12.920 --> 00:08:18.210
Come to think of it, sleeping in
a woman's room seems kind of shady...

00:08:20.880 --> 00:08:25.420
Come to think of it, that's the first time
anyone's ever talked to me like that...

00:08:26.130 --> 00:08:28.540
Um... pretty women, at that.

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:35.080
Is the stuff that happens in shojo manga
really happening to me?!

00:08:41.790 --> 00:08:45.580
My poor room...
I hope she doesn't do any more damage...

00:09:02.330 --> 00:09:03.750
You aren't Kiriya.

00:09:05.880 --> 00:09:09.630
I figured I'd ask her to make me a late-night snack...

00:09:09.630 --> 00:09:11.960
Miss Serene...?

00:09:13.000 --> 00:09:15.750
Kiriya made another mess.

00:09:18.080 --> 00:09:21.420
The misbehavior of a servant
is the responsibility of their master.

00:09:21.420 --> 00:09:27.210
If you, too, agree to become Serene's servant,
I can repair the floor using lunar technology.

00:09:28.250 --> 00:09:30.790
Well? Do you agree?

00:09:31.500 --> 00:09:33.830
I'm not sure what that means, but...

00:09:33.830 --> 00:09:37.540
If you can fix it, then please do...

00:09:38.380 --> 00:09:39.880
As you wish.

00:10:07.420 --> 00:10:10.630
Whoa! This is amazing, Koushi!

00:10:11.170 --> 00:10:13.630
You managed to make it look
even better than before!

00:10:14.000 --> 00:10:15.880
You've got some real talent, don'tcha?!

00:10:17.080 --> 00:10:18.250
Huh...?

00:10:18.250 --> 00:10:20.080
What the heck's going on here?

00:10:20.080 --> 00:10:22.250
I don't remember fixing anything...

00:10:24.710 --> 00:10:26.080
Wait a minute...

00:10:26.420 --> 00:10:29.080
That was a dream, right...?

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:34.960
Episode 2

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:34.960
Atena Awakens

00:10:50.460 --> 00:10:53.750
Morning, Koushi. What are you up to?

00:10:54.000 --> 00:10:55.960
Good morning, Miss Atena.

00:10:55.960 --> 00:10:58.830
I settled on vegetable soup for breakfast.

00:10:58.830 --> 00:11:01.210
Are you making that for us?!

00:11:01.210 --> 00:11:03.290
Well, I am the dorm mother.

00:11:03.290 --> 00:11:06.790
I used up all the leftovers that were
sitting in the fridge, though...

00:11:06.790 --> 00:11:08.420
To make THAT?!

00:11:08.420 --> 00:11:10.460
When cooked properly,

00:11:10.460 --> 00:11:14.790
onions and carrot peels can produce
a delicious and highly nutritious soup stock.

00:11:14.790 --> 00:11:16.250
Wow...

00:11:16.250 --> 00:11:18.250
Something smells heavenly!

00:11:18.250 --> 00:11:19.960
Oh my, breakfast?

00:11:19.960 --> 00:11:22.130
It's almost like an ordinary dorm.

00:11:26.130 --> 00:11:27.670
Mr. Fuki Mamoru!

00:11:28.670 --> 00:11:30.130
Those shan't stop me!

00:11:30.130 --> 00:11:31.330
We'll see about that!

00:11:31.330 --> 00:11:32.380
Back, fiend!

00:11:32.380 --> 00:11:33.500
Too slow!

00:11:33.790 --> 00:11:34.790
Atena's not half bad, is she?

00:11:34.790 --> 00:11:35.540
Atena's not half bad, is she?
Ha! This is exactly what I imagined
would happen when I practiced last night!

00:11:35.540 --> 00:11:38.420
They sure have a lot of energy
first thing in the morning...
Ha! This is exactly what I imagined
would happen when I practiced last night!

00:11:38.420 --> 00:11:40.330
C'mon, Mineru! Please quit moving!

00:11:40.330 --> 00:11:42.000
Hey, Koushi! I didn't know you can cook.
C'mon, Mineru! Please quit moving!

00:11:42.000 --> 00:11:42.380
Hey, Koushi! I didn't know you can cook.

00:11:42.380 --> 00:11:44.210
Good morning, Miss Kiriya.

00:11:44.540 --> 00:11:46.040
I wouldn't call it cooking.

00:11:46.040 --> 00:11:48.830
It's just a basic soup that I threw together
with ingredients that we already had.

00:11:48.830 --> 00:11:50.750
Whoa! That's so cool!

00:11:50.750 --> 00:11:54.960
Nah, it's really no big deal.
But that's very kind of you to say.

00:11:58.380 --> 00:12:00.080
M-Miss Serene?!

00:12:02.130 --> 00:12:03.250
It's tasty.

00:12:03.580 --> 00:12:05.330
I expected nothing less of my servent.

00:12:05.330 --> 00:12:06.170
Huh?

00:12:14.960 --> 00:12:16.080
Miss Serene!

00:12:16.080 --> 00:12:18.710
A bowl! Let me put it in a bowl for you first!

00:12:24.830 --> 00:12:27.380
Isn't this nice? A homemade breakfast.

00:12:27.380 --> 00:12:29.130
Excellent job, Koushi!

00:12:29.380 --> 00:12:31.750
Oh, no. It's the least I could do.

00:12:32.000 --> 00:12:35.460
Alrighty! For your reward,
I'd like you try out my newest concoction!

00:12:35.710 --> 00:12:37.580
Try on my newest costume!

00:12:38.080 --> 00:12:40.670
Come spar with me after breakfast, Koushi!

00:12:41.460 --> 00:12:46.080
Koushi... When did he become
such good friends with everyone?

00:12:46.330 --> 00:12:48.710
It hasn't been that long since he moved in...

00:12:48.710 --> 00:12:52.080
How does he get along so well
with a bunch of misfits like-

00:12:52.710 --> 00:12:53.920
Wait a minute...!

00:12:53.920 --> 00:12:56.000
Did something happen between them
when I wasn't around?!

00:12:58.420 --> 00:13:00.210
Make dinner tonight.

00:13:01.080 --> 00:13:04.040
He even managed to tame
a wild animal like Serene?!

00:13:04.040 --> 00:13:06.920
Are you sure? Should I handle dinner, too?

00:13:06.920 --> 00:13:10.540
That'd be great.
None of us are very good at cooking.

00:13:10.790 --> 00:13:14.540
I see Atena giving it a try
every now and then, though.

00:13:14.920 --> 00:13:16.460
So, you usually eat...?

00:13:16.460 --> 00:13:17.750
Microwave meals!

00:13:17.750 --> 00:13:19.170
I thought so...

00:13:19.500 --> 00:13:22.580
In that case, I'd like to make
a trip to the grocery store.

00:13:22.580 --> 00:13:25.250
Do you have money that I can use
for our food budget?

00:13:25.250 --> 00:13:26.460
Over there!

00:13:26.830 --> 00:13:30.330
Piggy Bank

00:13:26.830 --> 00:13:30.330
of Love

00:13:26.840 --> 00:13:28.630
The money in there is up for grabs.

00:13:28.630 --> 00:13:30.330
Oh, and by the way...

00:13:30.330 --> 00:13:31.830
the money comes out of its butt.

00:13:31.830 --> 00:13:33.080
That's awkward...

00:13:33.290 --> 00:13:36.540
But, uh... Are you sure it's alright if I use it?

00:13:36.540 --> 00:13:38.080
Go right ahead.

00:13:38.080 --> 00:13:40.460
We know that we can count on you, Koushi.

00:13:40.460 --> 00:13:43.000
And we all live under the same roof, don't we?

00:13:43.000 --> 00:13:45.000
I can't wait for dinner...

00:13:45.000 --> 00:13:46.580
Thank you so much!

00:13:46.580 --> 00:13:48.670
'Kay, I'll be back later!

00:13:49.000 --> 00:13:51.130
So something did happen...

00:13:51.130 --> 00:13:56.460
Otherwise, it's hard to imagine that everyone
would trust him with something so important...

00:13:57.130 --> 00:13:59.130
Me, too! I'll help do the shopping!

00:13:59.130 --> 00:14:00.500
Miss Atena?!

00:14:00.710 --> 00:14:01.880
Are you sure...?

00:14:01.880 --> 00:14:04.000
Y-yes. Of course!

00:14:04.000 --> 00:14:05.580
I appreciate it.

00:14:06.080 --> 00:14:07.670
I have to see for myself...

00:14:07.670 --> 00:14:10.330
After all, Koushi is a guy.

00:14:10.330 --> 00:14:13.330
How exactly did he win them over?

00:14:13.670 --> 00:14:16.420
Until I figure it out, I can't let my guard down.

00:14:16.670 --> 00:14:18.330
What about her condition?

00:14:18.330 --> 00:14:19.500
"Condition"...?

00:14:19.500 --> 00:14:21.250
Her condition. Y'know...

00:14:27.630 --> 00:14:29.210
An aversion to men.

00:14:37.040 --> 00:14:38.040
I...

00:14:38.920 --> 00:14:40.920
It's not... an aversion!

00:14:40.920 --> 00:14:42.960
They make me nervous, is all!

00:14:42.960 --> 00:14:45.540
S-sorry. I won't do that again.

00:14:45.670 --> 00:14:47.630
A-anyways, let's get going!

00:14:47.630 --> 00:14:49.880
P-please wait up, Miss Atena!

00:15:02.790 --> 00:15:04.960
Are you going to be okay, Miss Atena?

00:15:05.290 --> 00:15:09.000
I'll be fine. I've got a mask
and I'm wearing nose plugs underneath.

00:15:09.210 --> 00:15:12.460
Um, you don't have to help
if it's too much of a hassle...

00:15:12.460 --> 00:15:14.960
I'm telling you, I'm fine! C'mon, let's go!

00:15:18.580 --> 00:15:20.960
AHHHHH...

00:15:23.460 --> 00:15:25.540
This doesn't bode well...

00:15:25.790 --> 00:15:30.000
Seiyuu Supermarket

00:15:27.420 --> 00:15:30.000
On second thought, maybe we oughtta go home...

00:15:30.380 --> 00:15:34.500
There's no need to worry.
I brought plenty of spare nose plugs.

00:15:31.920 --> 00:15:36.790
Her second mask

00:15:34.500 --> 00:15:36.790
That's, uh, not what I meant...

00:15:36.790 --> 00:15:38.080
Follow me.

00:15:38.080 --> 00:15:39.080
Shuffle-shuffle...

00:15:39.670 --> 00:15:40.580
Shuffle-shuffle...

00:15:46.330 --> 00:15:47.670
Welcome!

00:15:49.250 --> 00:15:50.670
Thank you!

00:15:52.210 --> 00:15:54.540
I'd say our mission was successful.

00:15:55.210 --> 00:15:57.460
You're amazing, Miss Atena.

00:15:57.460 --> 00:15:58.210
Huh?

00:15:58.210 --> 00:16:01.330
Most people run away from things
that make them uncomfortable.

00:16:01.330 --> 00:16:03.080
They aren't as brave as you.

00:16:03.380 --> 00:16:05.170
But I'm running away, too.

00:16:05.170 --> 00:16:07.130
I think you're facing it head-on.

00:16:07.130 --> 00:16:09.040
From my perspective, you're doing great.

00:16:09.330 --> 00:16:13.040
And not just now.
The day that I first arrived at the dorm, too.

00:16:13.670 --> 00:16:16.580
It made me really happy.

00:16:17.080 --> 00:16:21.580
You conquered your fears,
and you carried me back home.

00:16:22.000 --> 00:16:26.630
So, in reality, the fact that I get to
live in the dorm is all thanks to you!

00:16:27.960 --> 00:16:29.920
You're wrong, Koushi.

00:16:30.830 --> 00:16:36.580
If anything... it's actually because
you forgave me for running away that day.

00:16:37.880 --> 00:16:41.080
That's why I was able to relax a little.

00:16:41.080 --> 00:16:44.830
I got one step farther by facing others
and by facing myself.

00:16:45.290 --> 00:16:48.210
It's because of you, Koushi, that I...

00:16:49.460 --> 00:16:52.040
So this is how you won them over!

00:16:52.040 --> 00:16:53.250
It's indecent!

00:16:53.250 --> 00:16:54.630
IMMORAL CONDUCT!

00:16:54.630 --> 00:16:55.670
WHAT?!

00:16:55.920 --> 00:16:57.290
Miss Atena, watch out!

00:16:57.290 --> 00:16:57.960
Huh?

00:16:57.960 --> 00:16:58.880
Oof.

00:17:06.500 --> 00:17:08.460
Shoot, my nose plugs...!

00:17:08.960 --> 00:17:13.210
This is bad! I can't let my nose
start gushing blood in public...!

00:17:13.750 --> 00:17:16.710
Sorry, Big Sis! I didn't mean to rush you!

00:17:18.670 --> 00:17:19.580
It's alright!

00:17:19.580 --> 00:17:22.420
There's no need to hurry.
The ice cream won't melt right away.

00:17:22.420 --> 00:17:24.500
Sorry for bumping into you.

00:17:24.500 --> 00:17:25.460
Bye!

00:17:26.830 --> 00:17:29.630
You can relax now, Miss Atena!

00:17:32.460 --> 00:17:33.830
What is this place?

00:17:33.830 --> 00:17:36.500
When I absolutely have to go into town,

00:17:36.500 --> 00:17:39.330
I come to this internet café
if I need a minute to catch my breath.

00:17:40.040 --> 00:17:43.630
Is she mad...? Can't blame her, I guess.

00:17:43.630 --> 00:17:46.250
Out of everyone I could've grabbed like that,

00:17:46.250 --> 00:17:49.580
I just had to choose the woman who nearly faints
whenever she touches a man...

00:17:49.580 --> 00:17:51.330
Like rubbing salt in a wound...

00:17:51.630 --> 00:17:52.880
Please forgive me!

00:17:52.880 --> 00:17:56.290
You weren't wearing your nose plugs,
and I got caught up in the moment...!

00:17:56.290 --> 00:17:58.830
It's fine. I'm not mad at you for that.

00:17:58.830 --> 00:18:00.920
Is it 'cause I carried you?!

00:18:00.920 --> 00:18:02.670
It's 'cause I carried you, right?!

00:18:03.040 --> 00:18:04.670
That's not it, either...

00:18:05.790 --> 00:18:09.040
I want you to... call me "Big Sis"...

00:18:09.040 --> 00:18:10.170
Come again?

00:18:10.170 --> 00:18:14.460
I said, can you try calling me
"Big Sis" one more time?!

00:18:15.830 --> 00:18:17.040
'Scuse me?

00:18:17.420 --> 00:18:19.670
But, uh, why would I do that...?

00:18:19.670 --> 00:18:21.630
Don't ask questions! Please!

00:18:21.630 --> 00:18:22.960
Okay...

00:18:24.290 --> 00:18:26.210
B-Big Sis...

00:18:33.210 --> 00:18:34.830
O-one more time!

00:18:34.830 --> 00:18:35.960
Big Sis.

00:18:36.710 --> 00:18:38.580
T-try it another way!

00:18:38.580 --> 00:18:40.420
B-Big Sister...?

00:18:40.960 --> 00:18:42.130
Another!

00:18:42.130 --> 00:18:43.580
Uh... Sister.

00:18:44.040 --> 00:18:45.380
Gimme all you got!

00:18:45.380 --> 00:18:46.380
Sissy.

00:18:46.670 --> 00:18:49.170
What is this glorious sensation?!

00:18:49.420 --> 00:18:50.790
It's my first time...!

00:18:50.790 --> 00:18:53.460
Is this what it feels like to have a little brother?!

00:18:54.380 --> 00:18:57.040
The warmth is building up inside of me...!

00:18:58.960 --> 00:19:00.540
M-Miss Atena...?

00:19:00.540 --> 00:19:02.040
Call me "Big Sis"!

00:19:02.040 --> 00:19:03.460
Okay, Big Sis!

00:19:08.250 --> 00:19:10.250
Wait, maybe if I try it now...

00:19:10.460 --> 00:19:12.250
C'mere, Koushi.

00:19:12.250 --> 00:19:13.880
O-okay...

00:19:20.040 --> 00:19:22.790
Thanks for protecting me back there.

00:19:23.130 --> 00:19:27.040
If anything ever happens,
I'll be sure to keep you safe, too.

00:19:27.830 --> 00:19:30.330
From now on, just think of me...

00:19:32.630 --> 00:19:34.380
...as your older sister.

00:19:34.380 --> 00:19:35.330
What?

00:19:36.330 --> 00:19:38.080
A-anyhow...

00:19:38.580 --> 00:19:40.210
I promise to watch out for you!

00:19:41.670 --> 00:19:42.500
Huh?

00:19:51.040 --> 00:19:52.330
I'm sorry!

00:19:55.790 --> 00:19:57.170
I-it's stuck...!

00:19:57.420 --> 00:19:59.420
Let go! Let gooo!

00:20:16.580 --> 00:20:19.580
NOOOOO!

00:20:24.540 --> 00:20:28.580
I'm sorry for everything
I put you through today, Miss Atena...

00:20:28.580 --> 00:20:31.830
But thank you. For coming with me.

00:20:33.250 --> 00:20:34.880
You shouldn't thank me.

00:20:34.880 --> 00:20:37.670
I assumed terrible things about you.

00:20:37.670 --> 00:20:41.380
It wasn't fair of me to think that you did
something sneaky to win everyone over...

00:20:41.960 --> 00:20:46.330
Each of them spent time with you,
and that's why they trusted you.

00:20:47.170 --> 00:20:52.080
They were demonstrating that trust
in the best way that they knew how.

00:20:52.460 --> 00:20:55.790
Meanwhile, I was overly suspicious...

00:20:55.790 --> 00:20:57.080
I'm sorry.

00:20:57.080 --> 00:20:59.500
Well then, what now?

00:20:59.750 --> 00:21:02.580
There's got to be something I can do to help him...

00:21:04.630 --> 00:21:05.790
It's delicious!

00:21:06.130 --> 00:21:07.830
You're right!

00:21:07.830 --> 00:21:09.290
The energy is overflowing...

00:21:09.290 --> 00:21:11.420
I could eat this every day!

00:21:11.420 --> 00:21:13.080
Thanks, everyone.

00:21:14.290 --> 00:21:16.830
What can I do to help him...?

00:21:17.130 --> 00:21:18.920
Over here, Koushi!

00:21:18.920 --> 00:21:21.380
Come sit on my lap and have dinner with us.

00:21:22.210 --> 00:21:24.130
C'mon. "Ahh"...

00:21:25.130 --> 00:21:26.790
P-please stop squishing me.

00:21:26.790 --> 00:21:27.880
No can do!

00:21:27.880 --> 00:21:29.290
Go on."Ahh"...

00:21:31.210 --> 00:21:32.830
Mr. Fuki Mamoru!

00:21:32.830 --> 00:21:35.040
Aw, let us have some fun, wouldja?

00:21:35.040 --> 00:21:36.960
Why don't you join us, Atena?

00:21:36.960 --> 00:21:38.250
I refuse!

00:21:38.250 --> 00:21:39.380
U-um...

00:21:40.580 --> 00:21:42.580
Cut it out! You're getting way too close to him!

00:21:44.040 --> 00:21:46.420
Sticky

00:21:45.040 --> 00:21:45.920
Oops.

00:21:46.790 --> 00:21:47.880
Disrobing.

00:21:47.880 --> 00:21:48.790
What?!

00:21:48.790 --> 00:21:49.790
Serene?!

00:21:51.790 --> 00:21:53.380
Stop that this instant!

00:21:54.210 --> 00:21:58.170
From here on out, I intend to watch over Koushi
and serve as an older sister figure for him!

00:21:58.170 --> 00:22:00.960
So be aware that, as his sister,
I'll be keeping a close eye on you!

00:22:00.960 --> 00:22:02.670
Isn't that right, Koushi?

00:22:03.250 --> 00:22:05.670
R-right... Big Sis.

00:22:09.580 --> 00:22:11.170
Call me "Big Sis," too!

00:22:11.170 --> 00:22:12.750
I'm more like a "Big Sis," anyway!

00:22:12.750 --> 00:22:14.880
Alrighty, then I'll just be "Sis."

00:22:14.880 --> 00:22:16.920
In that case, call me "Sister Dearest"!

00:22:16.920 --> 00:22:18.000
"Sissy."

