Good to see you again, Koushi.

00:23:54.000 --> 00:23:55.130
Wh-who are you...?

00:23:55.130 --> 00:23:57.000
Don't try to act like you don't remember me.

00:23:57.000 --> 00:23:58.130
I'm your-

00:23:58.130 --> 00:23:59.420
My long-lost little sister?

00:23:59.420 --> 00:24:01.580
Wrong! Wait, did you really forget?!

00:24:01.580 --> 00:24:04.670
No, of course not! You're... uh... y'know...

00:24:04.670 --> 00:24:07.080
How dare you?! It hasn't even been that long!

00:24:07.080 --> 00:24:10.880
Koushi, At a Loss

00:24:07.080 --> 00:24:10.880
Koushi Goes Back to School

